@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
title Preparing for the next lesson

participant ":LessonCommands" as Commands
participant ":TutorLedgerData" as Data

[-> Commands : execute("next")
activate Commands
Commands -> Data : getLessons()
activate Data
Data --> Commands : all lessons
deactivate Data
note right of Commands
  Choose the earliest lesson that has not
  started, is not cancelled and is not recorded.
end note

opt an upcoming lesson exists
  Commands -> Data : getStudent(lesson's student ID)
  activate Data
  Data --> Commands : student
  deactivate Data
  Commands -> Commands : describeLastTopic, describeOutstandingHomework,\ndescribeUnpaid, describeFollowUps
  activate Commands
  note right of Commands
    Each helper reads its own records
    (lessons, homework, tasks) from the store.
  end note
  deactivate Commands
end
Commands -->[ : summary, or "No upcoming lessons."
deactivate Commands
@enduml
